{
  "version": 1,
  "source": "08_验证策略.md §3.11 L1 事务原子清单",
  "$comment": "事务是**随机化的最小单元**（§3.9）。每条给出：构成它的指令组（ops，顺序即发射顺序）、前置条件（requires，人读）、硬约束（hard，L0 机器可读）、效应（effects）。编码表里没有这些 —— 它们是事务层语义，只能来自文档。",
  "transactions": [
    {
      "id": "mask_txn",
      "group": "control",
      "ops": [
        "group_mask_drv_xn"
      ],
      "requires": [
        "无"
      ],
      "hard": [
        {
          "kind": "mask_nonzero",
          "target": "group_mask",
          "note": "core_mask ≠ 0；全零的异常语义待定"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "set_global_mask",
          "target": "nice"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cfg_txn",
      "group": "control",
      "ops": [
        "npu_cfg_drv_xn"
      ],
      "requires": [
        "mask 已设置"
      ],
      "hard": [
        {
          "kind": "cfg_reg_legal",
          "target": "rs1val[31:16]",
          "note": "必须是合法 cfg_reg 地址"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "update_config",
          "target": "selected_cores"
        }
      ],
      "note": "形状不变时可复用"
    },
    {
      "id": "wr_lmem_txn",
      "group": "control",
      "ops": [
        "wr_lmem_drv_xn"
      ],
      "requires": [
        "mask"
      ],
      "hard": [
        {
          "kind": "align",
          "target": "spad",
          "param": 4
        },
        {
          "kind": "region",
          "target": "lmem.spad"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "write",
          "target": "spad",
          "span": "32bit 覆盖写"
        }
      ],
      "roles": {
        "binds": [],
        "writes": [
          "dst"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rd_lmem_txn",
      "group": "control",
      "ops": [
        "rd_lmem_drv_xn"
      ],
      "requires": [
        "mask"
      ],
      "hard": [
        {
          "kind": "align",
          "target": "spad",
          "param": 4
        },
        {
          "kind": "region",
          "target": "lmem.spad"
        },
        {
          "kind": "mask_cardinality",
          "target": "xn",
          "param": 1,
          "note": "xn 形式仅选 1 核"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "read",
          "target": "spad",
          "span": "rdval"
        }
      ],
      "roles": {
        "binds": [
          "src"
        ],
        "writes": []
      },
      "operands": {
        "rd_lmem_drv_xn": {
          "rs1val": "src"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rd_csr_txn",
      "group": "control",
      "ops": [
        "csr_read"
      ],
      "requires": [
        "mask"
      ],
      "hard": [
        {
          "kind": "csr_addr_legal"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "read",
          "target": "csr",
          "span": "rdval"
        }
      ],
      "deferred": true,
      "note": "文档 §3.2/§3.11 把 rd_csr_drv_xn 列为 Control 指令，但《指令编码总表》的 ctrl sheet 里没有它（只有 10 条，不含 csr 类）。CSR 访问在表里是非指令 op（csr_read/csr_write，走 csr_agent）。**不发明编码** —— 记为不可用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sync_txn",
      "group": "control",
      "ops": [
        "sync_drv_xn"
      ],
      "requires": [
        "无"
      ],
      "hard": [],
      "effects": [
        {
          "kind": "barrier",
          "target": "local_masters"
        }
      ],
      "note": "fast 变体无返回、不阻塞"
    },
    {
      "id": "noc_1to1_txn",
